flowchart TD
  subgraph Frontend [Angular Client]
    direction TB
    A[Login Page / Authentication UI] -->|POST /auth/login| B[AuthService]
    B -->|store JWT| C[StorageService (localStorage)]
    C --> D[AuthInterceptor]
    D -->|Bearer JWT| E[API Request to Backend]
    A1[AuthGuard] -->|protects routes| B1[Role-based route activation]
    B1 -->|authorized | E
    B1 -->|unauthorized| F[Redirect to /unauthorized or login]
  end

  subgraph Backend [Spring Boot Server]
    direction TB
    E --> G[SecurityConfig]
    G --> H[JwtAuthenticationFilter]
    H -->|extract + validate JWT| I[JwtTokenProvider]
    I -->|verify signature / expiry| H
    H -->|create Authentication| J[SecurityContext]
    J -->|access decision| K[Controller / Service Layer]
    K --> L[CustomUserDetailsService]
    L --> M[register_associate table]
  end

  subgraph DataStore [Database]
    direction TB
    M
  end

  subgraph PublicEndpoints [Unauthenticated Endpoints]
    direction TB
    P1[/auth/**] -->|permitAll| G
    P2[/swagger-ui/**] -->|permitAll| G
  end

  subgraph ProtectedAPIs [Authenticated APIs]
    direction TB
    P3[/api/**] -->|hasRole / hasAnyRole| G
  end

  C -. stores token .-> D
  H -. checks Authorization header .-> D
  B -->|navigates after login| B1
  K -->|reads/writes| M
  L --->|lookup user data| M
